# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` (the Git for Windows default) checks files
# out as CRLF while Biome and Prettier-style tooling expect LF, so `biome ci`
# fails locally and then passes on Linux CI — a difference that looks like a
# code defect and is not one. Declaring it here makes the two agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.avif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
